- Data contracts and schema drift
- Dynamic masking of PII
- GDPR delete and lineage preservation
- Iceberg lakehouse semantics
- Spark vs Flink trade-offs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: mask PII fields for non-admins
function maskPII(record, role) {
  if (role !== 'admin') {
    record.email = '***@***';
    record.phone = record.phone?.replace(/\\d/g, 'x');
  }
  return record;
}
```

